OL,3,GNEWSANorth Edinburgh tram extension
OL,4,Acould be shelved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a new tramline linking
OL,7,Fthe north and centre of Edinburgh are
OL,8,Flikely to be shelved following a row
OL,9,Fover the proposed route.
OL,11,FCity of Edinburgh Council would prefer
OL,12,Fto run the extension from Granton via
OL,13,Fthe Roseburn Path, but has faced strong
OL,14,Fopposition from campaigners and local
OL,15,Fresidents.
OL,17,FAn alternative line, which would run
OL,18,Facross Dean Bridge from Orchard Brae,
OL,19,Fwas also under consideration, however a
OL,20,Freport before the local authority's
OL,21,Ftransport and environment committee has
OL,22,Frecommended halting plans for now.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
