OL,3,GNEWSANorth Edinburgh tram extension
OL,4,Acould be shelved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA separate southern-only extension,
OL,7,Fconnecting Princes Street with the
OL,8,FRoyal Infirmary and BioQuarter
OL,9,Fdevelopment, is set to go ahead as a
OL,10,F"priority".
